    crgo:CRGO_0000330 "Expected Utility: The strategic importance of assets involved in this scenario would depend on the specific systems and data that could be compromised. Without detailed knowledge, it is challenging to estimate the expected utility accurately"@en,
        "Here's what I can help with"@en,
        "Implement the principle of least privilege, ensuring that users only have the specific access privileges required to perform their job functions"@en,
        "Mitigation Measures: Here are some general mitigation measures for this scenario"@en,
        "Probability of Exploitation: Similarly, the probability of exploitation would require an in-depth understanding of the existing security controls, architecture, and any vulnerabilities present. It is best to consult with technical experts to assess this probability accurately"@en,
        "Utilize two-factor authentication or multi-factor authentication to add an extra layer of security"@en .

