    crgo:CRGO_0000322 crgo:CRGO_0000304 ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000329 "healthcare" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000330 "Conduct regular security audits and assessments to identify and address potential weaknesses in the API infrastructure"@en,
        "Encrypt sensitive patient data both during transit and at rest to prevent unauthorized access"@en,
        "Implement robust logging and monitoring mechanisms to detect and respond to any suspicious activities or unauthorized access attempts"@en,
        "Implement strong authentication and access controls for all APIs, including the use of secure token-based authentication mechanisms"@en,
        "Provide regular cybersecurity training for all employees to promote awareness and educate them about the risks associated with insecure APIs"@en,
        "Regularly update and patch API software and libraries to address any known security vulnerabilities"@en .

