    crgo:CRGO_0000330 "Employee awareness and training: Train employees on safe coding practices, secure development techniques, and general cybersecurity awareness"@en,
        "Implement strong security controls: Apply strong access controls, authentication mechanisms, and data encryption to protect machine learning models and the data they process"@en,
