        "Monitoring and logging: Implement robust monitoring and logging capabilities to detect any suspicious activities or potential attacks on machine learning libraries"@en,
        "Regular vulnerability assessments: Conduct regular vulnerability assessments to identify any vulnerabilities in machine learning libraries and address them promptly"@en,
        "Stay updated: Keep machine learning libraries and dependencies up-to-date with the latest security patches and fixes"@en .

