    crgo:CRGO_0000318 lib:F0781-source ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000329 "healthcare" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000330 "Conduct regular security awareness training: Educate employees about voice spoofing attacks and provide guidance on how to identify and report suspicious activities"@en,
        "Employ secure communication channels: Use encrypted communication protocols, such as Secure Sockets Layer (SSL) or Transport Layer Security (TLS), to protect voice calls from eavesdropping and tampering"@en,
        "Implement strong authentication mechanisms: Use multi-factor authentication, such as biometrics or hardware tokens, to ensure the identity of individuals accessing sensitive systems or data"@en,
        "Implement voice authentication technologies: Deploy voice recognition systems that can verify the caller's identity by analyzing their unique voice patterns"@en,
        "Monitor and analyze voice traffic: Utilize intrusion detection and prevention systems to detect and mitigate voice spoofing attempts in real-time"@en,
        "for voice spoofing attacks"@en .

