    crgo:CRGO_0000330 ", please consider the following general suggestions: Mitigation Measures"@en,
        "Conduct regular training and education for staff involved in emergency response to ensure they are aware of potential issues related to inaccurate location data"@en,
        "Establish redundant communication channels to provide alternative means for emergency service dispatch"@en,
        "Implement a robust authentication and access control system to ensure accuracy and integrity of location data"@en,
        "Regularly test and evaluate the emergency response system to identify any vulnerabilities or weaknesses"@en,
        "Regularly update and maintain location services to minimize inaccuracies and delays in emergency services"@en .

