    crgo:CRGO_0000250 "LIB-F0790" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000287 "combined_file.xlsx rows R0464" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000322 crgo:CRGO_0000304 ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000329 "healthcare" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000330 "Conduct employee training and awareness programs: Educate employees about the risks associated with geolocation data and provide guidelines on the secure handling and protection of sensitive information"@en,
        "Develop an incident response plan: Have a well-defined and tested incident response plan in place to respond effectively in case of any breach or misuse of geolocation data"@en,
        "Encrypt geolocation data: Use strong encryption algorithms to protect the stored and transmitted geolocation data from unauthorized access"@en,
        "Implement strong access controls: Ensure that only authorized personnel have access to geolocation data systems and limit access privileges based on job roles and responsibilities"@en,
        "Monitor and detect suspicious activities: Implement a robust monitoring system to identify any suspicious or anomalous activities related to the geolocation data"@en,
        "Regularly update security patches: Keep all systems and applications up to date with the latest security patches to mitigate known vulnerabilities"@en .

