    crgo:CRGO_0000322 crgo:CRGO_0000304 ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000329 "healthcare" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000330 "Conduct regular training sessions for employees to raise awareness about data transfer policies and procedures"@en,
        "Develop and enforce a comprehensive data transfer policy that addresses security requirements, access control, encryption, and monitoring"@en,
        "Implement a secure file transfer system or solution to encrypt and authenticate data in transit"@en,
        "Implement data loss prevention (DLP) solutions to detect and prevent unauthorized data transfers"@en,
        "Monitor network traffic and log all data transfers for auditing purposes"@en,
        "for the Inadequate Policy Enforcement for Data Transfer scenario, along with some general considerations: Mitigation Measures"@en .

