    crgo:CRGO_0000330 "Implement encryption: Use encryption protocols, such as VPN or SSL/TLS, to secure data in transit between different network segments"@en,
        "Implement strong network access controls: Set up appropriate firewall rules, secure network gateways, and enable multi-factor authentication for network access"@en,
        "Implement strong network segmentation: Isolate critical systems and sensitive data from less secure parts of the network to limit unauthorized access"@en,
        "Regularly update and patch network devices: Keep all virtualization platforms, routers, switches, and associated software up to date with the latest security patches"@en,
        "Utilize network monitoring and intrusion detection systems: Deploy advanced monitoring tools to identify and respond to any suspicious activities or potential breaches"@en,
        "for insecure virtual networks enabling unauthorized data transfers. Here are some common strategies that can help prevent or mitigate such risks: Mitigation Measures"@en .

