lib:F1509 a crgo:CRGO_0000024 ;
    rdfs:label "Unauthorized live streaming of sensitive hospital procedures"@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000196 lib:F1509-event ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000246 theme:ThemeReputation ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000250 "LIB-F1509" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000287 "combined_file.xlsx rows R1071" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000318 lib:F1509-source ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000329 "healthcare" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000330 "Access controls and authentication: Implement strong access controls, multi-factor authentication, and role-based access control (RBAC) to ensure that only authorized personnel can access sensitive procedures"@en,
        "Based on the given scenario, here are some mitigation measures that can be considered"@en,
        "Employee awareness and training: Conduct regular cybersecurity awareness training sessions to educate all personnel on the risks associated with unauthorized live streaming and ensure they adhere to security policies and procedures"@en,
        "Enhanced monitoring: Deploy real-time monitoring systems to detect and prevent any unauthorized live streaming activities within the hospital's network"@en,
        "Incident response plan: Develop a robust incident response plan that outlines the steps to be taken in case of unauthorized live streaming incidents, including escalation procedures, communication channels, and recovery strategies"@en,
        "Strengthen network security: Implement firewalls, intrusion detection/prevention systems, and network segmentation to prevent unauthorized access and mitigate the risk of live streaming"@en .

