    crgo:CRGO_0000329 "healthcare" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000330 "Conduct frequent tests to verify the integrity and accessibility of backup data"@en,
        "Ensure that backup data is encrypted both during transmission and at rest"@en,
        "Implement a robust backup strategy that includes regular backups to multiple off-site locations"@en,
        "Implement strict access controls and authentication mechanisms to protect backup locations"@en,
        "Train employees on proper backup procedures and the importance of data security"@en .

