        "Implement secure communication protocols for data transmission between AR/VR devices and servers"@en,
        "Regularly update and patch AR/VR devices and servers to address any security vulnerabilities"@en,
        "Train employees on secure usage of AR/VR devices and raise awareness about potential threats"@en .

lib:F1680 a crgo:CRGO_0000024 ;
