    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "An attacker successfully impersonates the CEO of the hospital through an email. The attacker convinces a staff member to transfer a large sum of money to a fraudulent account under the guise of an urgent financial matter, resulting in a significant financial loss for the hospital."@en ;
