    crgo:CRGO_0000329 "healthcare" ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000330 "access controls: restrict access to sensitive hospital data to only those employees who require it for their job duties"@en,
        "employee training: hospital staff should receive regular training on how to identify social engineering attacks and the proper protocols for handling such situations"@en,
        "incident response plan: develop and regularly test an incident response plan to address social engineering attacks and minimize damage"@en,
        "multi-factor authentication: implement multi-factor authentication for all hospital systems and email accounts to prevent unauthorized access"@en,
        "regular system updates: ensure all hospital systems and software are up-to-date with the latest security patches to prevent malware infections"@en,
        "train staff on how to identify and respond to social engineering attacks"@en .

